+issueNumber: MDL-89289
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new ad-hoc task `\core\task\uninstall_plugin_task` and the helper
+        `upgrade_queue_uninstall_plugin_task()` in `lib/db/upgradelib.php`
+        have been added. Core plugins which were removed from Moodle (for
+        example `mod_chat`, `mod_survey` and `editor_atto`) are no longer
+        uninstalled synchronously during the core upgrade. Instead, the
+        upgrade queues an ad-hoc task for each plugin which is no longer
+        present on disk, and the uninstallation is performed by cron once
+        the upgrade has completed.
+      type: changed
